            {
                "entry_id": "727a7dda-b143-3db4-8f55-b600ff8c3813",
                "word": "шур",
                "pos": "onomatopeia",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1dd850df-13a2-3b55-bc80-be5aa7a53af6",
                        "entry_id": "727a7dda-b143-3db4-8f55-b600ff8c3813",
                        "glosses": [
                            "используется для передачи шуршания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f5e4698-a08d-492a-a167-fd612a0cd325",
                                "sense_id": "1dd850df-13a2-3b55-bc80-be5aa7a53af6",
                                "text": "По ветровому стеклу ударили крупные капли, и Валёк включил дворники. Шур… шур…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "572447da-5437-4237-937d-94b1cb82f99e",
                                "sense_id": "1dd850df-13a2-3b55-bc80-be5aa7a53af6",
                                "text": "Когда в доме все уснули, из-под стола вдруг послышалось противное шуршание — шур… шур. шур.. Это по полу полз Чёрный Утюг. Его шнур извивался, как змея — шур. шур. шур.. Услышав шуршание, девочка проснулась и увидела, как Чёрный Утюг заползает на шкаф.〈…〉С деловым шуршанием он пробрался в шкаф, выгладил платье и уполз обратно под стол."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c91421d2-bbd7-4ae3-85df-171efd226272",
                                "sense_id": "1dd850df-13a2-3b55-bc80-be5aa7a53af6",
                                "text": "И вот раз вечером прибегла из магазина — и одеваться. Перчатки лайковые по сих пор надела… — Куда собралась?〈…〉В четвёртом часу ночи — звонок. — Что так рано? — спрашиваю. — Потому что не поздно!.. Дерзко так. Прошла мимо меня — шур-шур юбками. И так от неё духами. Перчатки сорвала, швырнула."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f62146fe-2bc0-48f7-97da-d940936658a4",
                                "sense_id": "1dd850df-13a2-3b55-bc80-be5aa7a53af6",
                                "text": "— Если ты, негодный, чихнёшь мне в кастрюльку, я тебя утоплю! Буль-буль! Так он всегда говорил, когда очень сердился. А когда не очень, то шуршал камышом. Шур-шур-шур! Но если Вахмурку просили не чихать, ему, как нарочно, хотелось чихнуть ещё больше. Вахмурка чихнул."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "ed415582-bf5d-3a71-be46-96173a8e7cc5",
                "word": "шур",
                "pos": "particle",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b8fbbaf0-64ea-3bfe-b789-85ee2c34a947",
                        "entry_id": "ed415582-bf5d-3a71-be46-96173a8e7cc5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "конечно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "англицизм"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f0ebe9e-beee-4997-9dfa-f73f5a4e6278",
                                "sense_id": "b8fbbaf0-64ea-3bfe-b789-85ee2c34a947",
                                "text": "Ал тут же пришёл ей на помощь, он мягко сказал: — Барби, дорогая, Арт заглянул ко мне на минуту, прости меня, я скоро освобожусь. И она ответила: — Шур, милый, бай, профессор Лузинг! — и удалилась, сверкая попой, с достоинством английской королевы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "26bffd6c-db8b-494a-a2d9-a9a1ddc2f703",
                                "sense_id": "b8fbbaf0-64ea-3bfe-b789-85ee2c34a947",
                                "text": "— Видите? — спросил он, показывая грязным ногтем точку на карте. — Село Деллах. Там все русские, и ваш шеф с ними. Набираюсь храбрости: — Вы в этом уверены? — Шур, шур! Вне всякого сомнения. Все там!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9605246e-00fc-4b50-8299-8210094aba80",
                                "sense_id": "b8fbbaf0-64ea-3bfe-b789-85ee2c34a947",
                                "text": "Крикливым голосом американского оптимиста он будет рассказывать ему всё, что только знает. И в каждой его фразе будет — «шур!», что значит «конечно!», или «шурли!», что тоже значит «конечно!», или «оф корс!», что тоже значит «конечно!»"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "091e7b01-9368-4f74-be5a-7d9c6be5a76c",
                        "source_entry_id": "ed415582-bf5d-3a71-be46-96173a8e7cc5",
                        "source_sense_id": "b8fbbaf0-64ea-3bfe-b789-85ee2c34a947",
                        "target_lang_word": "sure",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b407ed3-fa87-33e2-b6da-1e73364c6252",
                                        "entry_id": "d80d53ae-a39a-3552-96ef-029028acbc1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Physically secure and certain, non-failing, reliable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a79b28b0-38d0-4aa6-baf4-cd841b256f45",
                                                "sense_id": "2b407ed3-fa87-33e2-b6da-1e73364c6252",
                                                "text": "This investment is a sure thing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c01950d3-dda6-4c9e-bda2-dd24f99c076b",
                                                "sense_id": "2b407ed3-fa87-33e2-b6da-1e73364c6252",
                                                "text": "The bailiff had a sure grip on the prisoner's arm."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe01e85f-01d3-4608-87c9-0741194d5454",
                                                "sense_id": "2b407ed3-fa87-33e2-b6da-1e73364c6252",
                                                "text": "'In the end,' said Mustapha Mond, 'the Controllers realized that force was no good. The slower but infinitely surer methods of ectogenesis, Neo-Pavlovian conditioning and hypnopædia…'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0762ddd-453a-3b6c-93f8-cbcc8c25ef97",
                                        "entry_id": "d80d53ae-a39a-3552-96ef-029028acbc1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certain in one's knowledge or belief."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "966e272c-69d2-4595-aff6-ff23672ac719",
                                                "sense_id": "f0762ddd-453a-3b6c-93f8-cbcc8c25ef97",
                                                "text": "The very excess of the extravagance, in fact, by suggesting to the reader continually the mere aeriality of the entire speculation, furnishes the surest means of disenchanting him from the horror which might else gather upon his feelings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7ecaa17-46bb-41ce-a9cb-3fe4f73d63d5",
                                                "sense_id": "f0762ddd-453a-3b6c-93f8-cbcc8c25ef97",
                                                "text": "The Celebrity, by arts unknown, induced Mrs. Judge Short and two other ladies to call at Mohair on a certain afternoon when Mr. Cooke was trying a trotter on the track. The three returned wondering and charmed with Mrs. Cooke; they were sure she had had no hand in the furnishing of that atrocious house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdf9767d-23a7-44f2-9a04-f1e80aa2f76f",
                                                "sense_id": "f0762ddd-453a-3b6c-93f8-cbcc8c25ef97",
                                                "text": "Roy: I'm 95% sure it was him.\nJen: You... you said you were 99% sure.\nRoy: I'm 97% sure it was him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60072610-7784-47ed-a8d7-c03d3c13286d",
                                                "sense_id": "f0762ddd-453a-3b6c-93f8-cbcc8c25ef97",
                                                "text": "Are you sure to succeed, as polls say? —Well, I am at least certain of making it to the podium this time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf4f90d6-9dd2-4506-be4b-5a61aced8d99",
                                                "sense_id": "f0762ddd-453a-3b6c-93f8-cbcc8c25ef97",
                                                "text": "He was sure of being a finalist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfe15cb6-3b31-4e5f-97f8-31c972e6b873",
                                                "sense_id": "f0762ddd-453a-3b6c-93f8-cbcc8c25ef97",
                                                "text": "They aren't sure who will attend for sure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7e01362-93e6-43a6-b14c-941dfe0251aa",
                                                "sense_id": "f0762ddd-453a-3b6c-93f8-cbcc8c25ef97",
                                                "text": "You seemed sure that the car was his. Yeah. I’m not sure what is the point of spending hours and hours discussing this."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "869e0664-db06-3195-816a-3f11369759ce",
                                        "entry_id": "d80d53ae-a39a-3552-96ef-029028acbc1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certain to act or be a specified way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "followed by a to infinitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d70050b6-7b3c-4fc1-9a57-3321408048b3",
                                                "sense_id": "869e0664-db06-3195-816a-3f11369759ce",
                                                "text": "Be sure to lock the door when you leave."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e587657-cc0a-3b11-a997-dbe1ea7e2681",
                                        "entry_id": "d80d53ae-a39a-3552-96ef-029028acbc1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Free from danger; safe; secure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03c75593-9f88-4de8-8bdd-9a15ca34b371",
                                                "sense_id": "7e587657-cc0a-3b11-a997-dbe1ea7e2681",
                                                "text": "Feare not: the Forreſt is not three leagues off, / If we recouer that, we are ſure enough."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a6e66be-9b41-3fdb-a0e2-234cb66ea1e4",
                                        "entry_id": "d80d53ae-a39a-3552-96ef-029028acbc1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Betrothed; engaged to marry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff749cf2-9547-4b66-b9f7-1fbae49d8ef2",
                                                "sense_id": "5a6e66be-9b41-3fdb-a0e2-234cb66ea1e4",
                                                "text": "c. 1513-1518 (probably date written, published after 1535) Thomas More, History of King Richard III\nThe king was sure to Dame Elizabeth Lucy, and her husband before God."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "269793fc-1aa3-4f43-9128-9fc676c59baf",
                                                "sense_id": "5a6e66be-9b41-3fdb-a0e2-234cb66ea1e4",
                                                "text": "I presum'd […] [that] you had been sure, as fast as faith could bind you, man and wife."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d2f8e1d-28ea-3179-8bed-9c1e7af01e5d",
                                        "entry_id": "2855f587-c14b-3eba-81a9-2f1d265865ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without doubt, certainly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "modal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "395e165b-7126-419d-a2a4-6f26a1bc244f",
                                                "sense_id": "0d2f8e1d-28ea-3179-8bed-9c1e7af01e5d",
                                                "text": "Sure he's coming! Why wouldn't he?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74af318b-8721-4be3-b727-91afc1457ad5",
                                                "sense_id": "0d2f8e1d-28ea-3179-8bed-9c1e7af01e5d",
                                                "text": "\"Did you kill that bear yourself?\" ―\"I sure did!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c4caac9-e5f1-4f3f-ad35-e4e6c0e26a84",
                                                "sense_id": "0d2f8e1d-28ea-3179-8bed-9c1e7af01e5d",
                                                "text": "It sure is cold out"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1507407a-05cb-422e-8d65-371cc0b9c2d3",
                                                "sense_id": "0d2f8e1d-28ea-3179-8bed-9c1e7af01e5d",
                                                "text": "These high and gusty relishes of life, sure,\nHave no allayings of mortality in them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5222e17c-bfce-33a0-8d56-faf6d10537c3",
                                        "entry_id": "2855f587-c14b-3eba-81a9-2f1d265865ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without fail, surely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e44ce46-a9db-4247-8df5-e04e40096155",
                                                "sense_id": "5222e17c-bfce-33a0-8d56-faf6d10537c3",
                                                "text": "Theſe are the wings ſhall make it flie as ſwift,\nAs dooth the lightening: or the breath of heauen,\nAnd kill as ſure as it ſwiftly flies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed0f5469-8514-3714-8dbd-03dd02eeff4c",
                                        "entry_id": "b63702b9-f3e4-3c42-823f-92daa5126175",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Yes; of course."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in response to a request for help or a favour"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c5cb769-d07c-47bf-9434-cc246743fa16",
                                                "sense_id": "ed0f5469-8514-3714-8dbd-03dd02eeff4c",
                                                "text": "\"Could you tell me where the washrooms are?\" \"Sure, they're in the corner over there.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d75770f7-6efa-3fcb-a072-ef660ab24d8d",
                                        "entry_id": "b63702b9-f3e4-3c42-823f-92daa5126175",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Yes; I guess; you could say that; a weak or noncommittal positive response."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in response to other questions"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd70653a-97a9-42ff-bf54-dbca328f5347",
                                                "sense_id": "d75770f7-6efa-3fcb-a072-ef660ab24d8d",
                                                "text": "\"Do you like cats?\" \"Sure.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff4e36fc-bbfa-42c4-b14f-223e2e77baaf",
                                                "sense_id": "d75770f7-6efa-3fcb-a072-ef660ab24d8d",
                                                "text": "\"Do you want me to put this in the garage?\" \"Sure, go ahead.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "255f7bb7-61c7-3c4c-9add-16704b99a8bc",
                                        "entry_id": "b63702b9-f3e4-3c42-823f-92daa5126175",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "You're welcome; polite response to being thanked."
                                        ],
